            "review_title": "Review at IDLE Da Nang",
            "review_text": "Marika Dimiropulu\nMaldives5 contributions\n0\nGreat Experience\nAug 2026 • Friends\nA lovely café-bar with great food and a relaxed atmosphere\nI had a wonderful experience at IDLE Place in Da Nang. The atmosphere is cozy, stylish, and relaxed — perfect for breakfast, coffee, dinner, or drinks with friends.\nThe food was fresh and delicious, the cocktails were well made, and the staff were friendly and attentive. The menu has a good variety, and there is something for every time of day.\nThe place has a welcoming vibe, good music, and a comfortable atmosphere where you can relax and enjoy your time. I would definitely recommend IDLE Place to anyone looking for a nice café-bar in Da Nang. I will happily come back!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 3, 2026",
