            "review_title": "Review at IDLE Da Nang",
            "review_text": "Anastasiya A\nKryvyy Rih, Ukraine4 contributions\n0\nIDLE is one of my favorite spots in Da Nang\nAug 2026 • Friends\nIDLE is one of my favorite spots in Da Nang. I genuinely love this place — breakfast here is a great way to start the day, lunch always hits the spot, and dinner has its own special mood. It’s also become my go-to place to meet friends I love spending time with. Every visit feels a little different, but always warm and welcoming.\n\nThe menu offers an interesting take on European classics with a nice variety of dishes. One day I had the tartare for lunch, which was excellent, and came back the next morning for the eggs Benedict at breakfast — both were perfectly executed.\n\nOverall, this was the most wonderful experience I’ve had in Da Nang, thanks to the great service and genuinely friendly attitude of the whole team. Highly recommend.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 31, 2026",
